@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #334155
  FontColor #172D3B
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3D9
  DiamondBorderColor #334155
}
start
:Create encoder;
:Declare modules / code
or code-less placeholders,
resources and constant payloads
in a valid creation order;
:Connect bindings, descriptors
and push-constant metadata;
:Add ordered segments
and model inputs / outputs;
:Finish
Finalize metadata;
:WriteTo an output stream
Consume copied constant buffers;
:VGF artifact
for consumers;
stop
@enduml
